{%- comment -%}
  CALQIX Tooth Atlas V2 - compact anatomy, tooth layers and function education.
{%- endcomment -%}

{% render 'cx-section-overrides', section: section %}
<section class="cx-root cx-section cx-tooth-atlas-v2" data-cx-reveal>
  <div class="cx-container">
    <div class="cx-stack cx-section-header cx-atlas-v2-header" data-cx-stagger>
      {% render 'cx-eyebrow', text: section.settings.eyebrow %}
      <h2 class="cx-h2">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
      <div class="cx-lede">{{ section.settings.lede }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="cx-atlas-v2-shell" data-cx-stagger>
      <div class="cx-atlas-v2-visual" aria-label="Simplified tooth layer diagram">
        <div class="cx-atlas-v2-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="cx-atlas-v2-tooth" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="cx-atlas-v2-crown"></span>
          <span class="cx-atlas-v2-enamel"></span>
          <span class="cx-atlas-v2-dentin"></span>
          <span class="cx-atlas-v2-pulp"></span>
          <span class="cx-atlas-v2-root"></span>
          <span class="cx-atlas-v2-gum"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="cx-atlas-v2-callouts">
          <span style="--x: 15%; --y: 21%;">Enamel</span>
          <span style="--x: 69%; --y: 28%;">Dentin</span>
          <span style="--x: 16%; --y: 54%;">Pulp</span>
          <span style="--x: 64%; --y: 71%;">Root support</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cx-atlas-v2-nutrition">
          <p>Feed the system</p>
          <span>Calcium</span>
          <span>Phosphorus</span>
          <span>Vitamin D</span>
          <span>Protein</span>
          <span>Water</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cx-atlas-v2-panel" data-cx-tooth-atlas>
        <div class="cx-atlas-v2-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Tooth layers">
          <button type="button" class="cx-atlas-v2-tab cx-is-active" data-cx-tooth-pill="atlas-enamel" role="tab" aria-selected="true">
            <span>01</span> Enamel
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="cx-atlas-v2-tab" data-cx-tooth-pill="atlas-dentin" role="tab" aria-selected="false">
            <span>02</span> Dentin
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="cx-atlas-v2-tab" data-cx-tooth-pill="atlas-pulp" role="tab" aria-selected="false">
            <span>03</span> Pulp
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="cx-atlas-v2-tab" data-cx-tooth-pill="atlas-root" role="tab" aria-selected="false">
            <span>04</span> Root
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="cx-atlas-v2-tab" data-cx-tooth-pill="atlas-gumline" role="tab" aria-selected="false">
            <span>05</span> Gumline
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="cx-atlas-v2-panels">
          <article class="cx-atlas-v2-layer cx-is-active" data-cx-tooth-panel="atlas-enamel" role="tabpanel">
            <div class="cx-eyebrow">Outer shield</div>
            <h3>Enamel protects the bite.</h3>
            <p>Enamel is the hard mineral surface that helps teeth cut, crush and resist daily acid attacks. Humans need it because chewing starts digestion before food is swallowed.</p>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Maintain</dt><dd>Brush gently, clean between teeth, limit frequent sugar and acidic sipping.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Eat</dt><dd>Calcium, phosphorus and vitamin D from dairy, fortified foods, leafy greens, nuts and fish.</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </article>

          <article class="cx-atlas-v2-layer" data-cx-tooth-panel="atlas-dentin" role="tabpanel">
            <div class="cx-eyebrow">Sensitive core wall</div>
            <h3>Dentin gives structure and feel.</h3>
            <p>Dentin sits under enamel. Its tiny tubules can transmit cold, heat and acid sensitivity when protection is thin or roots are exposed.</p>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Maintain</dt><dd>Avoid hard scrubbing, manage grinding, and protect exposed necks around the gumline.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Eat</dt><dd>Protein, minerals and water support saliva, the natural buffer that helps protect dentin.</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </article>

          <article class="cx-atlas-v2-layer" data-cx-tooth-panel="atlas-pulp" role="tabpanel">
            <div class="cx-eyebrow">Living center</div>
            <h3>Pulp keeps the tooth alive.</h3>
            <p>The pulp contains nerves and blood vessels. It lets you feel pain when decay, cracks or infection get too close to the center.</p>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Maintain</dt><dd>Do not ignore lasting sensitivity, swelling or deep pain. That is dentist territory.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Eat</dt><dd>A balanced diet helps tissue repair, but pulp health mainly depends on preventing deep decay.</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </article>

          <article class="cx-atlas-v2-layer" data-cx-tooth-panel="atlas-root" role="tabpanel">
            <div class="cx-eyebrow">Anchor system</div>
            <h3>Cementum and ligament hold position.</h3>
            <p>Cementum covers the root, while the periodontal ligament connects the tooth to the jaw socket. This lets teeth absorb chewing force instead of acting like rigid pegs.</p>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Maintain</dt><dd>Clean the gumline daily and keep bite pressure balanced, especially if you clench.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Eat</dt><dd>Vitamin C, protein and minerals support the tissues that surround the root.</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </article>

          <article class="cx-atlas-v2-layer" data-cx-tooth-panel="atlas-gumline" role="tabpanel">
            <div class="cx-eyebrow">Protective seal</div>
            <h3>Gums protect roots and bone.</h3>
            <p>Healthy gums seal around teeth and protect the roots. When plaque stays at the margin, inflammation can make teeth feel loose or sensitive over time.</p>
            <dl>
              <div><dt>Maintain</dt><dd>Clean between teeth, rinse debris away, and give the back molars extra attention.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Eat</dt><dd>Crunchy vegetables, vitamin C rich fruit, enough protein and plenty of water support gum resilience.</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cx-atlas-v2-role-grid" aria-label="Tooth type roles">
      <article>
        <span>Incisors</span>
        <h3>First bite</h3>
        <p>Cut fruit, bread and vegetables. They also help shape clear front-of-mouth speech sounds and show edge wear early.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>Canines</span>
        <h3>Guide and tear</h3>
        <p>Grip food and help guide side-to-side jaw movement, reducing overload on smaller contact points.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>Premolars</span>
        <h3>Break down</h3>
        <p>Bridge front and back teeth. They crush food into smaller pieces so molars can grind efficiently.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>Molars</span>
        <h3>Main engine</h3>
        <p>Do most chewing. Cleaner molar grooves support better chewing, easier swallowing and steadier nutrition.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>Wisdom teeth</span>
        <h3>Late space test</h3>
        <p>Third molars can be useful when fully erupted, but partial eruption often creates hard-to-clean pockets.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="cx-atlas-v2-body-note">
      <strong>Whole-body link:</strong>
      <span>Teeth do not have a proven organ-by-organ map. Their reliable influence is through chewing, speech, jaw load, nutrition, sleep comfort and inflammation control.</span>
    </div>

    {%- if section.settings.cta_text != blank -%}
      <div class="cx-atlas-v2-cta">
        <a class="cx-atlas-v2-button" href="{{ section.settings.cta_link | default: '#' }}">
          {{ section.settings.cta_text }}
          <span aria-hidden="true">-></span>
        </a>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cx-tooth-atlas-v2 {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(247, 250, 255, .9), rgba(255, 255, 255, 1) 34%, rgba(241, 247, 255, .72));
  }

  .cx-tooth-atlas-v2::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(0, 37, 73, .045) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0, 37, 73, .045) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 38px 38px;
    mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, #000 14%, #000 86%, transparent);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .cx-tooth-atlas-v2 .cx-container { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .cx-atlas-v2-header { max-width: 820px; margin-inline: auto; }

  .cx-atlas-v2-shell {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(330px, .9fr) minmax(420px, 1.1fr);
    gap: clamp(18px, 3vw, 34px);
    align-items: stretch;
    margin-top: clamp(26px, 5vw, 58px);
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-visual,
  .cx-atlas-v2-panel {
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 37, 73, .16);
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .82);
    box-shadow: 0 26px 70px rgba(0, 37, 73, .08);
    backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-visual {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 490px;
    overflow: hidden;
    isolation: isolate;
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-orbit {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 58px 34px 104px;
    border-radius: 42% 42% 48% 48%;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 50% 18%, rgba(255, 255, 255, .92) 0 12%, transparent 13%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 50% 45%, rgba(0, 118, 194, .13), transparent 48%),
      linear-gradient(150deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, .96), rgba(226, 239, 252, .62));
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 118, 194, .14);
    transform: rotate(-2deg);
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-tooth {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 52px;
    width: min(62%, 300px);
    height: 382px;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-crown,
  .cx-atlas-v2-enamel,
  .cx-atlas-v2-dentin,
  .cx-atlas-v2-pulp,
  .cx-atlas-v2-root,
  .cx-atlas-v2-gum {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-crown {
    top: 0;
    width: 210px;
    height: 168px;
    border-radius: 52% 48% 42% 42% / 58% 58% 38% 38%;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #fff, #e9f4ff 70%);
    border: 2px solid rgba(0, 37, 73, .12);
    box-shadow: inset 16px -20px 44px rgba(0, 118, 194, .12);
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-enamel {
    top: 24px;
    width: 154px;
    height: 112px;
    border-radius: 50% 50% 38% 38%;
    border: 2px solid rgba(0, 118, 194, .24);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .45);
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-dentin {
    top: 46px;
    width: 108px;
    height: 128px;
    border-radius: 48% 48% 38% 38%;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(209, 170, 84, .24), rgba(255, 255, 255, .2));
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-pulp {
    top: 76px;
    width: 38px;
    height: 210px;
    border-radius: 28px 28px 52px 52px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0, 118, 194, .82), rgba(0, 37, 73, .88));
    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 118, 194, .24);
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-root {
    top: 154px;
    width: 122px;
    height: 224px;
    border-radius: 34px 34px 72px 72px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, .86), rgba(226, 239, 252, .96));
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 37, 73, .13);
    z-index: -1;
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-gum {
    top: 142px;
    width: 292px;
    height: 70px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(218, 171, 148, .76), rgba(246, 214, 199, .78));
    filter: blur(.1px);
    z-index: -2;
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-callouts span {
    position: absolute;
    left: var(--x);
    top: var(--y);
    padding: 7px 10px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 37, 73, .14);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .78);
    color: #002549;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 37, 73, .08);
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-nutrition {
    position: absolute;
    left: 24px;
    right: 24px;
    bottom: 22px;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-nutrition p {
    flex: 0 0 100%;
    margin: 0 0 2px;
    color: #8a6a2a;
    font-family: var(--cx-f-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: .18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-nutrition span {
    padding: 8px 11px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(0, 37, 73, .06);
    color: #16385b;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-panel {
    padding: clamp(18px, 2.6vw, 30px);
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-tabs {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-tab {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 48px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 7px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 37, 73, .12);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .74);
    color: #16385b;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    transition: transform .28s ease, border-color .28s ease, background .28s ease, color .28s ease, box-shadow .28s ease;
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-tab span {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(0, 37, 73, .08);
    font-family: var(--cx-f-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-tab:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: rgba(0, 118, 194, .28);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 37, 73, .08);
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-tab.cx-is-active {
    background: #002549;
    color: #fff;
    border-color: #002549;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 38px rgba(0, 37, 73, .18);
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-tab.cx-is-active span { background: #d1aa54; color: #002549; }

  .cx-atlas-v2-layer {
    display: none;
    min-height: 306px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 37, 73, .12);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: clamp(20px, 3vw, 34px);
    background:
      linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, .96), rgba(239, 246, 255, .78)),
      radial-gradient(circle at 86% 10%, rgba(0, 118, 194, .11), transparent 34%);
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-layer.cx-is-active {
    display: block;
    animation: cxAtlasLayerIn .34s ease both;
  }

  @keyframes cxAtlasLayerIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-layer h3 {
    margin: 8px 0 12px;
    color: #002549;
    font-family: var(--cx-f-display);
    font-size: clamp(31px, 4vw, 48px);
    line-height: .98;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-layer p {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0;
    color: #1d3d60;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.62;
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-layer dl {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 22px 0 0;
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-layer dl div {
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 37, 73, .1);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 14px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .72);
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-layer dt {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    color: #8a6a2a;
    font-family: var(--cx-f-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: .15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-layer dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: #16385b;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-role-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 18px;
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-role-grid article {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: 168px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 37, 73, .13);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 18px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .82);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 46px rgba(0, 37, 73, .06);
    transition: transform .28s ease, box-shadow .28s ease, border-color .28s ease;
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-role-grid article::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: auto -24px -36px auto;
    width: 92px;
    height: 92px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0, 118, 194, .12), transparent 67%);
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-role-grid article:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: rgba(0, 118, 194, .32);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 37, 73, .11);
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-role-grid span {
    color: #8a6a2a;
    font-family: var(--cx-f-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: .15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-role-grid h3 {
    margin: 10px 0 8px;
    color: #002549;
    font-family: var(--cx-f-display);
    font-size: 25px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-role-grid p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #1d3d60;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-body-note {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: center;
    margin: 18px auto 0;
    max-width: 980px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 118, 194, .18);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 12px 18px;
    background: rgba(233, 244, 255, .82);
    color: #16385b;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-body-note strong { color: #002549; white-space: nowrap; }

  .cx-atlas-v2-cta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    min-height: 54px;
    padding: 0 28px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #002549, #00528f);
    color: #fff !important;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 42px rgba(0, 37, 73, .2);
    transition: transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease, filter .25s ease;
  }

  .cx-atlas-v2-button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    color: #fff !important;
    filter: saturate(1.08);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 58px rgba(0, 37, 73, .28);
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .cx-atlas-v2-shell { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cx-atlas-v2-visual { min-height: 390px; }
    .cx-atlas-v2-tooth { height: 310px; top: 34px; transform: translateX(-50%) scale(.86); transform-origin: top center; }
    .cx-atlas-v2-tabs {
      display: flex;
      overflow-x: auto;
      padding-bottom: 4px;
      scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    }
    .cx-atlas-v2-tab {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      min-width: 132px;
      scroll-snap-align: start;
    }
    .cx-atlas-v2-role-grid {
      display: flex;
      overflow-x: auto;
      padding: 2px 2px 16px;
      scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    }
    .cx-atlas-v2-role-grid article {
      flex: 0 0 min(78vw, 260px);
      scroll-snap-align: start;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .cx-tooth-atlas-v2 { padding-top: 56px; padding-bottom: 56px; }
    .cx-atlas-v2-header { text-align: left; }
    .cx-atlas-v2-visual,
    .cx-atlas-v2-panel { border-radius: 18px; }
    .cx-atlas-v2-visual { min-height: 315px; }
    .cx-atlas-v2-orbit { inset: 38px 18px 86px; }
    .cx-atlas-v2-tooth { top: 28px; transform: translateX(-50%) scale(.68); }
    .cx-atlas-v2-callouts span {
      padding: 6px 8px;
      font-size: 9.5px;
    }
    .cx-atlas-v2-callouts span:nth-child(2),
    .cx-atlas-v2-callouts span:nth-child(4) { display: none; }
    .cx-atlas-v2-nutrition {
      left: 14px;
      right: 14px;
      bottom: 14px;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .cx-atlas-v2-nutrition p { font-size: 10px; }
    .cx-atlas-v2-nutrition span {
      padding: 7px 9px;
      font-size: 11px;
    }
    .cx-atlas-v2-panel { padding: 14px; }
    .cx-atlas-v2-layer {
      min-height: 0;
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 16px;
    }
    .cx-atlas-v2-layer h3 { font-size: 32px; }
    .cx-atlas-v2-layer p { font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.52; }
    .cx-atlas-v2-layer dl { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 8px; margin-top: 16px; }
    .cx-atlas-v2-role-grid article { min-height: 152px; }
    .cx-atlas-v2-body-note {
      align-items: flex-start;
      border-radius: 16px;
      flex-direction: column;
      padding: 13px 14px;
    }
    .cx-atlas-v2-body-note strong { white-space: normal; }
    .cx-atlas-v2-button {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 52px;
      padding-inline: 18px;
    }
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "CX Tooth Atlas V2",
  "tag": "section",
